{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_12225200","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12225200","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:7:1222520001:0":{"text":"そんな……流金の地がめちゃくちゃに！","source_cn":"天啊……流金之地变得一片狼藉了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x945EE1060A2E3A5D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1222520002:0":{"text":"山のような金貨や、お宝は？あの立派なボトルシップは！？","source_cn":"那些堆成山的金币，宝物……还有那艘漂亮的瓶中船呢？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFD9AF45AB647C70E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1222520003:1":{"text":"金貨と集めたお宝は、全部あの野蛮なカタストロフが呑み込んだのよ！ボトルシップも、あいつの頭突きで粉々に砕けちゃったわ！","source_cn":"我可以回答：金币和收集来的宝物，被那头野蛮的恶魔一口气...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD48B2FD9569F32C5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1222520004:1":{"text":"しかもおまけとばかりに、汚らわしい魔物の眷族を大量に残して行ったの！","source_cn":"而且那家伙大闹完，还留下这么多污浊丑陋的魔物眷属！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD46C9A2733BFB3CA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1222520005:1":{"text":"……呑み込んだ？あんな大量のお宝を？どんな胃袋だよ。","source_cn":"……吞了？那么多宝贝？他能吃得下？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x385DC990DF9E90E9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"",